            "message": "fix(curriculum): step 41 envelope budget app use valid id selector\n\nTeach '#' + category + ' .input-container' so querySelector targets the\nelement by id. Previously category + ' .input-container' produced invalid\nselectors like 'rent .input-container' causing targetInputContainer to be null.\n\nFixes #69805",
