            },
            "message": "fix(curriculum): step 42 seed carries correct id selector from step 41\n\nUpdate seed code to '#' + category + ' .input-container' so it matches\nthe valid selector taught in step 41. Update description to say 'keep\nthe #' rather than 'add #', since the # is already present from step 41.\n\nFixes #69805",
