            },
            "committer": {
                "name": "Mohammed Hisham Moizuddin",
                "date": "2026-08-30T17:26:34Z"
            },
            "message": "fix(client): escape console output of JavaScript challenges\n\nThe in-app console renders its contents with dangerouslySetInnerHTML, so\nevery log has to be escaped before it reaches the store. The JavaScript\nbranch of previewChallengeSaga was the only path that skipped this, which\nmeant a learner who correctly logged an HTML entity saw the decoded\ncharacter instead.\n\nCloses #63788",
            "comment_count": 0
        },
        "author_id": 322678619,
        "committer_id": 322678619
    },
